---
config:
  layout: fixed
  theme: base
---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Target as ESP32-S3 Target
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant User as User

    Target->>Target: Advertise as PrecisionShot device
    User->>App: Open app and scan
    App->>Target: Scan for BLE advertisement
    App->>Target: Connect to target
    App->>Target: Request current state
    Target-->>App: Send mode, distance, threshold, battery, status
    User->>App: Change setting or start training
    App->>Target: Send command packet
    Target-->>App: Send updated state event
    Target->>Target: Continue standalone shot processing
    Target-->>App: Send shot packet when connected
    App->>App: Save shot to local history
    App--xTarget: Connection lost
    Target->>Target: Continue display, scoring, and logging
    App->>Target: Reconnect and request current state
    Target-->>App: Send latest state
